{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Misty's Idle Fishing is an idle desktop fishing game where you help misty on her journey to catch and research all sorts of fish from different islands across the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play on your desktop!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game sits anywhere on your desktop, and the idle gameplay means that Misty can catch fish while you get on with work, watch some videos, or do anything else on your pc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/chillin.gif?t=1747090273\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore 10 Locations!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade Misty's boat to explore 10 different locations! Each with their own look, feel and range of fish to catch and research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/all_islands_no_ui.gif?t=1747090273\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Purchase and unlock upgrades!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your research points to improve Misty's fishing gear, letting you catch better fish even faster, store more fish and bait, or get bonus luck! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/upgrade_shop.gif?t=1747090273\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Misty's and her boat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convert your research points into money, and spend it on customizing Misty's outfit, hairstyle and boat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537140?t=1747090273","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/8a4d0349cf67e535a2284e1667f3e5197a2a0f71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747090273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/0abcbd0